This does not include the files from SuperTux. If you're looking for that, please look at SuperTux's AUTHORS file.

== Images ==

images/tiles/tropical/palmtree.png - by FilipOK
The rest of the files in images/tiles/tropical are based on tiles made for SuperTux that were made by SuperTux Team but recolored / edited.
images/tiles/snow/icicle.png - by Grumbel (made for SuperTux)
images/tiles/jungle/stone.png - by Grumbel (made for SuperTux)
images/tiles/ghostforest/bones.png - by FilipOK
images/tiles/ghostforest/main.png - Edited tile versions of the Ghost Forest concepts made for SuperTux that were made by Grumbel, edited versions made by Vaesea
images/tiles/forest/earth-slopes.png - by FilipOK, edited versions of the SuperTux forest tileset by Grumbel
images/tiles/forest/grass.png - by FilipOK, edited versions of the SuperTux forest tileset by Grumbel
All files in images/tiles/desert/ - by FilipOK
images/background/snow_background2.png - by Grumbel, edited to loop correctly by Vaesea
All files in images/creatures/bumpkin/ - originally by Grumbel, edited to be yellow by Vaesea
All files in images/creatures/granito/ - originally by Grumbel, edited by Vaesea
All files in images/creatures/nolok/ - by FilipOK


